  "stem": "The function \\(f\\) is defined by \\(f(x) = 5(b)^{x}\\), where \\(b\\) is a positive constant. If \\(f(2) = 80\\), what is the value of \\(b\\)?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "4"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "\\(f(2) = 5b^{2} = 80\\), so \\(b^{2} = 16\\).",
    "Since \\(b\\) is positive, \\(b = 4\\)."
  ],
  "explanation": null,
